              "lines": [
                "<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">**German Power Price & Weather**</span><br>This dashboard tracks Germany's day-ahead electricity price (EUR/MWh) alongside renewable generation and weather observations, refreshed daily via an automated Databricks pipeline (Auto Loader → Lakeflow Declarative Pipelines → this dashboard). It explores how solar and wind output drive price down — sometimes below zero — and highlights when and why those negative-price events occur."
